node_modules/
.release-notes.md
scripts/redaction-terms.local.txt
.devcycle/
.superpowers/
.DS_Store
.worktrees/
graphify-out/

# Everything under docs/ is ignored and each tracked surface is re-included by name, so a new
# scaffolding directory is ignored by default and a new tracked doc is a deliberate line — the
# inverse of naming each stale directory individually and missing the next one.
# Audit reports are one-run records: written locally, never shipped to installers. The v0.12
# disposition register is a closure ledger docs/DECISIONS.md cites, so it is the one exception.
docs/*
!docs/*.md
!docs/comparisons/
!docs/devcycle/
!docs/audits/
!docs/design/
!docs/configuration/
docs/audits/*
!docs/audits/2026-08-06-disposition-register.md
!docs/audits/2026-08-23-repo-maintenance.md
